---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// A four-state trading MDP solved by value iteration (python3, 2,000 sweeps; output in the post notes).
// Regime U: expected +10 bp/day, regime D: -10 bp/day; regime stays with prob 0.9; cost 5 bp per position change; gamma 0.9.
// State = (regime, position held). Action = position to hold today (flat or long). Values in basis points.
const W = 900;
const H = 400;
const rows = [
  { r: ['Up regime, flat', 'Tăng, đứng ngoài'], f: '49.8', l: '58.4', best: 'l' },
  { r: ['Up regime, long', 'Tăng, đang giữ'], f: '44.8', l: '63.4', best: 'l' },
  { r: ['Down regime, flat', 'Giảm, đứng ngoài'], f: '27.6', l: '9.0', best: 'f' },
  { r: ['Down regime, long', 'Giảm, đang giữ'], f: '22.6', l: '14.0', best: 'f' },
];
const vi = (s: string) => s.replace('.', ',');
---
<figure class="p19-bm">
  <div class="p19-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: a two-regime market. In the up regime the expected return is plus 10 basis points a day, in the down regime minus 10. The regime stays the same with probability 0.9 and flips with probability 0.1. Right: the solved action values in basis points for four states, with a worked Bellman backup: buying from flat in the up regime is worth 5 plus 0.9 times 59.3, which is 58.4.">
      <text x="30" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>A toy market, solved with the Bellman equation</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Một thị trường đồ chơi, giải bằng phương trình Bellman</tspan>
      </text>

      <circle cx="110" cy="130" r="48" class="node up" />
      <text x="110" y="126" text-anchor="middle" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tăng</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="s">+10 bp/<tspan data-lang-en>day</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="320" cy="130" r="48" class="node dn" />
      <text x="320" y="126" text-anchor="middle" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Down</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giảm</tspan></text>
      <text x="320" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="s">−10 bp/<tspan data-lang-en>day</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày</tspan></text>
      <line x1="158" y1="118" x2="262" y2="118" class="arrow" /><polygon points="272,118 260,112 260,124" class="head" />
      <line x1="272" y1="144" x2="168" y2="144" class="arrow" /><polygon points="158,144 170,138 170,150" class="head" />
      <text x="215" y="108" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>0.1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,1</tspan></text>
      <text x="215" y="166" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>0.1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,1</tspan></text>
      <text x="110" y="210" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>stays: 0.9</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giữ nguyên: 0,9</tspan></text>
      <text x="320" y="210" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>stays: 0.9</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giữ nguyên: 0,9</tspan></text>

      <DiagramIcon name="measure" x={44} y={262} size={22} />
      <text x="70" y="256" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Each day: hold flat or long.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi ngày: đứng ngoài hoặc giữ.</tspan></text>
      <text x="70" y="276" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Changing position costs 5 bp.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đổi vị thế mất 5 bp.</tspan></text>
      <text x="70" y="296" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Discount γ = 0.9.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chiết khấu γ = 0,9.</tspan></text>

      <rect x="30" y="318" width="400" height="74" rx="8" class="note" />
      <text x="42" y="338" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Buy from flat in Up:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua khi đang đứng ngoài, regime Tăng:</tspan></text>
      <text x="42" y="358" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>5 + 0.9 × (0.9×63.4 + 0.1×22.6)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>5 + 0,9 × (0,9×63,4 + 0,1×22,6)</tspan></text>
      <text x="42" y="378" class="s2b"><tspan data-lang-en>= 5 + 0.9 × 59.3 ≈ 58.4 bp</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>= 5 + 0,9 × 59,3 ≈ 58,4 bp</tspan></text>

      <text x="470" y="62" class="col"><tspan data-lang-en>State</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>State</tspan></text>
      <text x="720" y="62" class="col" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>Q(flat)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Q(đứng ngoài)</tspan></text>
      <text x="850" y="62" class="col" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>Q(long)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Q(giữ)</tspan></text>
      {rows.map((r, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x="460" y={74 + i * 62} width="410" height="52" rx="6" class="row" />
          <text x="470" y={106 + i * 62} class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.r[0]}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.r[1]}</tspan></text>
          <rect x={r.best === 'f' ? 640 : 770} y={80 + i * 62} width={r.best === 'f' ? 90 : 90} height="40" rx="6" class="win" />
          <text x="720" y={106 + i * 62} text-anchor="end" class={r.best === 'f' ? 'num best' : 'num'}><tspan data-lang-en>{r.f}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{vi(r.f)}</tspan></text>
          <text x="850" y={106 + i * 62} text-anchor="end" class={r.best === 'l' ? 'num best' : 'num'}><tspan data-lang-en>{r.l}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{vi(r.l)}</tspan></text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="470" y="344" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Values in basis points. Highlighted: the action the agent picks.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá trị tính bằng điểm cơ bản. Tô nền: hành động agent chọn.</tspan></text>
      <text x="470" y="364" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>In the Down regime it sits flat even though flat earns 0 now:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ở regime Giảm nó đứng ngoài dù hiện tại đứng ngoài lãi 0:</tspan></text>
      <text x="470" y="382" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>the regime flips back with probability 0.1 each day.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>regime mỗi ngày có xác suất 0,1 quay lại.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say the market has two moods and the agent knows which one it is in. Q(state, action) is the total discounted reward from taking that action and then playing best. The numbers come from 2,000 sweeps of the Bellman update.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử thị trường có hai tâm trạng và agent biết đang ở tâm trạng nào. Q(state, action) là tổng phần thưởng đã chiết khấu nếu làm hành động đó rồi chơi tốt nhất về sau. Con số lấy từ 2.000 lượt cập nhật Bellman.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p19-bm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p19-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p19-bm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p19-bm text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p19-bm .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-bm .t { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-bm .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-bm .s2 { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-bm .s2b { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-bm .col { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-bm .lab { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-bm .num { font-size: 15px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-bm .num.best { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-bm .node { stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .p19-bm .node.up { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .p19-bm .node.dn { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .p19-bm .arrow { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .p19-bm .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-bm .row { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .p19-bm .win { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p19-bm .note { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p19-bm figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
